<title>USA: Landry's Seafood preliminary Q4 shr $0.14.</title>
<headline>Landry's Seafood preliminary Q4 shr $0.14.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Landry's Seafood Restaurants Inc said late on Tuesday that it expects to report earnings of $0.14 per share for the fourth quarter ended December 31, compared to $0.09 for the year-ago quarter.</p>
<p>The company said fourth quarter revenues will be about $52 million. It said it would report results by February 12.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
